// A refusal for a named address space (`__seg_gs`, `__seg_fs`): a read or write
// through it reaches the segment, and the flat store has none. Kept like any
// deferred refusal for the function it turns out to be in; a declaration that
// defines no function (a per-CPU variable, a typedef, a struct) is not told at
// once but poisons what it declares (defer_poison).
defer_seg(int dg_tk, string dg_msg) {
  push((import pdtk), dg_tk);
  push((import pdmsg), dg_msg);
  push((import pdsg), 1);
} return void;
